ON CREATE SET n.unique_id = replace(randomUUID(), '-', ''), n.date_created = date('2026-10-23'), n.depreciated = false, n.include_in_report = false
SET n.content = 'Maturity review, 2026-10-23 (Daniel Fontaine). Recorded status: Defined. The evidence supports: Defined. Confidence: low-medium.\n\nBasis: The listed item, Instructional Materials - ATI, is general guidance, not an example set. The August 2026 note describes Zach Oshri\'s practice: example documents by type in three categories (looks accessible but is not, obviously inaccessible, clean), emailed to attendees after each session. That practice is consistent and informal. Accessibility Compliance for Digital Teaching & Learning, not listed here, publishes the AY 2025-26 checklist, a recommended syllabus statement, and workshop materials, which partly covers distribution. Nothing records where the examples live or how they are updated.\n\nTo reach Established:\n1. Put the example documents in one published location and list it as evidence.\n2. Write a short procedure naming who refreshes the examples and when.\n3. List the Online Campus compliance page as evidence here too.\n\nRecord problems: The 2024-2025 note (no formal process) is still in the report, and the August 2026 note says it is out of date. Both links lack a strength rating.'
MERGE (y)-[:has_note]->(n)
MERGE (n)-[:created_by]->(p);

MATCH (y:YearSuccessEvidence {year_identifier: '2025-2026-7.5-ins-csueb'})
