SET n.content = 'Maturity review, 2026-10-23 (Daniel Fontaine). Recorded status: Defined. The evidence supports: Defined. Confidence: low-medium.\n\nBasis: The only item is Accessibility Compliance for Digital Teaching & Learning, which describes a coordinated multi-year effort with regular reporting to campus leadership, a rollout timeline and workshops each term. That is a consistent but informal communication practice. The 2024-2025 note is adverse and still included: no formal communication campaign with executive support. There is no executive-signed message, named sponsor, campaign plan or reach measure. If the 2024-2025 note still holds, the grade is borderline Initiated.\n\nTo reach Established:\n1. Get a written message on Title II responsibilities from the Provost or President, and keep it.\n2. Write the campaign down: audiences, channels, schedule and owner, starting from the readiness timeline.\n3. Refresh or replace the 2024-2025 note so it reflects this year.\n\nRecord problems: The 2024-2025 note carries forward unchanged. Strength is unset.'
