ON CREATE SET n.unique_id = replace(randomUUID(), '-', ''), n.date_created = date('2026-10-23'), n.depreciated = false, n.include_in_report = false
SET n.content = 'Maturity review, 2026-10-23 (Daniel Fontaine). Recorded status: Defined. The evidence supports: Defined. Confidence: medium-high.\n\nBasis: Annual Back to the Bay Workshops has schedules, a slide deck and a sign-in sheet, showing a recurring accessibility workshop over two years. The August 2026 note holds the grade. New Faculty Orientation covers tenure-track faculty only, and lecturers have no equivalent. The accessibility segment depends on an invitation to Accessibility Services, appears in no position description, and is absent from the published orientation description. Workshop attendance is optional, and Extension faculty are excluded. The joint training plan is Not Started.\n\nTo reach Established:\n1. Give accessibility a fixed slot in New Faculty Orientation\'s published agenda, with a named presenter whose role covers it.\n2. Create orientation coverage for lecturers.\n3. Add the accessibility content to the published orientation description and keep the attendee lists and slides each year.\n\nRecord problems: Only Back to the Bay is listed; New Faculty Orientation has no item. The schedule document title is misspelled (Workshow). Cheryl Saelee\'s attendee list and deck are still outstanding.'
