MERGE (n:Note {name: 'maturity-review-oct-2026-yse:2025-2026-8.14-ins-csueb-727d6146'})
ON CREATE SET n.unique_id = replace(randomUUID(), '-', ''), n.date_created = date('2026-10-23'), n.depreciated = false, n.include_in_report = false
SET n.content = 'Maturity review, 2026-10-23 (Daniel Fontaine). Recorded status: Initiated. The evidence supports: Initiated. Confidence: high.\n\nBasis: The only listed item is 24-25 CIC 47/FAC 14/FDEC 5, an adoption policy that does not answer professional development. A 2026-08 note gives the one real instance: Zach Oshri attends employer-funded conferences with a role-based expectation. Dawna Komorosky says her role has no budget or expectation for this training. The 2024-2025 note says there is no formal process. Practice is ad hoc and limited to one person.\n\nTo reach Defined:\n1. Agree on a common practice for the staff who carry this work in Online Campus, the Library, Faculty Development and Accessibility Services: who attends what, how often, and how it is approved.\n2. Identify the positions that need this training and the budget source, and put both in the campus plan.\n3. Keep a working list of training completed by those staff in a shared campus location.\n\nRecord problems: CIC 47 is listed here but does not answer the indicator, and has no owner. Its page title is misspelled. The note dates the policy February 13 2005 and the description says 2025.'
