ON CREATE SET n.unique_id = replace(randomUUID(), '-', ''), n.date_created = date('2026-10-23'), n.depreciated = false, n.include_in_report = false
SET n.content = 'Maturity review, 2026-10-23 (Daniel Fontaine). Recorded status: Not Started. The evidence supports: Not Started. Confidence: medium.\n\nBasis: No steering committee review of an instructional materials plan happened in 2025-26. Kristin Hart describes the old ATI committee as meeting infrequently, mainly to fill out the reporting form, and says it lost its purpose after the Title II date moved. Direction sits with Zach Oshri, and a formal directive for East Bay is still being sought. The listed CIC 47 policy is Senate policy approval, not committee review of a plan. The working group plan is In Progress and does not raise the grade. Initiated becomes defensible once a committee meets, even ad hoc, and the process is written into the campus plan.\n\nTo reach Initiated:\n1. Name the body that reviews and approves the instructional materials plan, either a reconstituted committee or the instructional materials working group, and hold a first review.\n2. Write the review cycle and membership into the campus ATI plan.\n3. Settle who completes the campus reporting going forward, given the move to central reporting.\n\nOwned by another area: The directive establishing the group runs through SFBRN leadership (Amanda McGowan and Jean).\n\nRecord problems: CIC 47 is listed but does not answer this indicator. The plan duplicates one on 9.3.'
MERGE (y)-[:has_note]->(n)
