SET n.content = 'Maturity review, 2026-10-23 (Daniel Fontaine). Recorded status: Not Started. The evidence supports: Not Started. Confidence: high.\n\nBasis: Nothing is listed. The notes record interest, not practice. Kristin Hart responded positively to forming the group and can bring in library staff, and Zach Oshri relayed that people convene a group when needed. The 2024-2025 note says a subcommittee still needs to be established. No subcommittee meets and no plan is being revised. Three plans are In Progress and do not count.\n\nTo reach Initiated:\n1. Convene the instructional materials working group with a named lead and members, and hold a first meeting.\n2. Record in the campus plan how the group will feed the annual plan and coordinate its implementation.\n3. Identify the staff time each member unit commits.\n\nOwned by another area: Same directive dependency as 9.2.\n\nRecord problems: Establish CSUEB Instructional Materials Working Group and CSUEB: Reconstitute the instructional materials working group duplicate each other. Assemble ATI Committee and Support Groups is SFBRN-wide.'
